WEBVTT

00:12.670 --> 00:14.720
Sensei. Libera-sensei?

00:16.090 --> 00:18.180
Oh. What is it, Destra-kun?

00:19.290 --> 00:21.470
Here...

00:23.640 --> 00:26.020
Today's your birthday, right?

00:26.350 --> 00:28.270
A present? For me?

00:31.860 --> 00:33.470
Anemone?

00:33.820 --> 00:36.410
Well, you said you liked them, so...

00:38.200 --> 00:40.260
Hehe...

00:43.700 --> 00:45.770
Well? Does it look good on me?

00:47.710 --> 00:48.690
Yes!

00:49.170 --> 00:51.920
Thank you, Destra-kun.

00:52.380 --> 00:55.400
I truly appreciate the sentiment.

00:56.880 --> 00:58.800
<i>Run! Hurry!</i>

01:18.210 --> 01:21.820
<i>Memories should all just die.</i>

01:27.810 --> 01:31.730
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

01:27.810 --> 01:31.730
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

01:28.890 --> 01:31.730
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

01:28.890 --> 01:31.730
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

01:28.890 --> 01:31.730
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

02:54.150 --> 02:59.110
<b>Destra the Absolute Death</b>

02:55.720 --> 02:58.780
I had you all come here for but one reason.

02:59.210 --> 03:06.450
Seiichi-kun, it's time to reveal the true 
reason I invited you to this academy.

03:08.030 --> 03:12.810
It was all because I anticipated the 
battles with the Great Devil Order.

03:13.640 --> 03:15.420
What do you mean?

03:16.170 --> 03:19.370
Those who take the Fruit of 
Evolution into themselves

03:19.370 --> 03:21.630
will inevitably cross paths 
with the Great Devil.

03:22.290 --> 03:26.950
I'm talking about you, Seiichi-kun.

03:27.940 --> 03:29.270
So you knew?

03:29.710 --> 03:32.190
Who do you think I am?

03:32.440 --> 03:34.110
A perverted old man!

03:34.110 --> 03:35.570
A masochistic old man!

03:35.570 --> 03:38.410
Well, yes, those are true, too!

03:38.410 --> 03:39.860
All right, stop that.

03:39.860 --> 03:43.820
But why does the Fruit of Evolution have 
anything to do with the Great Devil?

03:43.820 --> 03:48.690
To get into that, we must first 
discuss the legend of creation.

03:49.710 --> 03:54.530
It starts in ancient times, when the 
gods were still creating this world.

03:56.290 --> 04:00.340
One day, a certain god revolted 
against the other gods

04:00.340 --> 04:02.970
so that they could reign supreme.

04:03.670 --> 04:06.220
Their conflict was the fiercest of all time,

04:06.220 --> 04:08.570
and much of the land was burnt to nothing,

04:08.830 --> 04:12.980
until the god that revolted was finally 
sealed away within this world.

04:13.980 --> 04:17.960
The god that revolted hated the 
other gods and cursed the world.

04:18.370 --> 04:24.570
That negative emotion took form, and the 
crystallization of hate that spilled forth

04:24.990 --> 04:27.770
was the Fruit of Evolution.

04:28.570 --> 04:30.410
The Fruit of Evolution proliferated

04:30.410 --> 04:33.020
with blinding speed, 
seeking to cover the whole world.

04:33.980 --> 04:38.570
The gods who noticed this used 
their power to suppress its spread,

04:38.570 --> 04:41.840
and now it's considered a legendary item.

04:46.390 --> 04:50.430
And that god who revolted 
is the Great Devil.

04:52.850 --> 04:56.440
Those who eat the maximum Fruits of Evolution

04:56.440 --> 04:59.290
eventually become fodder for the Great Devil.

04:59.290 --> 05:03.070
Fodder chock-full of the aura of despair.

05:03.780 --> 05:07.060
Master, how many Fruits of 
Evolution have you eaten?

05:07.630 --> 05:09.890
Ten, if I recall.

05:09.890 --> 05:10.990
Is that...

05:11.260 --> 05:12.910
It is the upper limit.

05:14.890 --> 05:16.250
Do not fear.

05:16.900 --> 05:20.620
Protecting you is my duty as the Holy Mage,

05:20.620 --> 05:23.400
and it's why I summoned you to the academy.

05:23.810 --> 05:25.230
Barnabus-san...

05:25.960 --> 05:29.250
I don't need any thanks. Instead,

05:29.250 --> 05:31.600
everyone pet my head!

05:31.600 --> 05:33.980
Old man!

05:33.070 --> 05:33.980
Here it comes!

05:42.190 --> 05:45.740
The Great Devil Order priest, Destra—

05:46.060 --> 05:50.570
I'm the one who ultimately created him.

05:52.490 --> 05:57.550
Long ago, he was a student here 
at Barbador Magic Academy,

05:57.550 --> 05:59.710
and my very own pupil.

06:04.040 --> 06:09.050
Riddle: What furniture makes your 
hands shake just by owning it?

06:09.490 --> 06:12.470
Hint: Your hands tremble!

06:12.840 --> 06:15.830
The answer is: a table!

06:16.140 --> 06:20.770
Riddle: What flower shouts when it's morning?

06:20.770 --> 06:23.850
Hint: In the morning, it howls!

06:23.850 --> 06:26.740
The answer is: a morning glory!

06:26.740 --> 06:28.090
Next one:

06:28.090 --> 06:32.320
A chair might be a chair, but what 
kind of chair is spicy and delicious?

06:32.320 --> 06:34.330
Hint: curry!

06:36.840 --> 06:40.250
Where are your mom and dad?

06:49.160 --> 06:51.430
Now, the next—ow!

06:51.430 --> 06:53.320
Shut up, you damn bastard!

06:53.690 --> 06:56.120
I'll die cursing the gods!

06:56.120 --> 06:57.480
Don't stop me!

06:57.810 --> 07:01.350
What's this crap about 
the gods and happiness?!

07:01.350 --> 07:05.270
They just steal from us, 
make us suffer, and deceive us!

07:05.910 --> 07:07.440
I'll kill those damn gods!

07:07.720 --> 07:09.860
I'll break this damn world, too!

07:09.860 --> 07:11.490
I'll curse it all,

07:11.700 --> 07:13.240
kill the gods,

07:13.240 --> 07:17.850
and destroy everything!

07:23.140 --> 07:29.770
I'll die cursing them!

07:29.770 --> 07:33.940
Mommy! Mommy!

07:41.770 --> 07:47.800
I am Barnabus Aevritt, a teacher 
at Barbador Magic Academy.

07:48.150 --> 07:51.890
If you are willing, I can help you.

07:55.260 --> 07:59.480
Destra lost his family in the last war,

07:59.480 --> 08:01.480
and ended up all alone.

08:01.870 --> 08:04.460
Hey, who's that?

08:02.290 --> 08:05.450
I took him into custody while he was hurting,

08:04.460 --> 08:06.350
Someone amazing?

08:05.450 --> 08:08.550
and had him enroll in this academy.

08:08.550 --> 08:12.350
This is Destra-kun. He'll be a 
part of your class from now on.

08:12.350 --> 08:14.470
Everyone be kind to him.

08:15.430 --> 08:17.310
Pardon me!

08:19.180 --> 08:21.100
Sorry I'm late!

08:23.190 --> 08:24.660
Libera-kun!

08:24.660 --> 08:26.830
That's the twelfth time this month!

08:26.830 --> 08:29.900
Are you not aware that you
are an assistant teacher—

08:30.160 --> 08:33.570
I see. So you're starting today, Destra-kun.

08:33.570 --> 08:35.190
Uh, yes.

08:35.190 --> 08:36.900
Thank you for having me.

08:38.260 --> 08:45.120
She was great at looking after the kids, 
and indispensable to the academy.

08:45.620 --> 08:49.290
Destra-kun had deep adoration 
for Libera-kun, as well.

08:50.040 --> 08:52.440
Hey! No sleeping in class!

08:52.860 --> 08:55.850
Now, when you're producing Ice Spear...

08:56.260 --> 08:58.760
You worked so hard, Destra-kun!

09:04.070 --> 09:05.640
A present?

09:05.640 --> 09:08.560
Well, um...

09:09.250 --> 09:10.980
A-ha!

09:12.470 --> 09:15.560
Let me guess. You found a girl you like, right?

09:16.260 --> 09:18.550
I-It's not like that.

09:20.270 --> 09:24.200
Well, if you're getting a present for a girl,

09:24.560 --> 09:26.370
it has to be flowers, I think.

09:26.370 --> 09:28.880
Wh-What kind of flowers 
would you like, Sensei?

09:29.280 --> 09:30.360
Me?

09:30.730 --> 09:32.340
If it were me...

09:32.650 --> 09:34.550
Oh, look there.

09:36.120 --> 09:37.940
They're called anemone.

09:38.760 --> 09:41.970
Their purple petals are 
so pretty, aren't they?

09:42.270 --> 09:45.660
Those flowers also mean 
"I'll believe in you and wait for you."

09:53.060 --> 09:56.580
Sensei. Libera-sensei?

09:57.990 --> 10:00.910
Oh. What is it, Destra-kun?

10:01.780 --> 10:02.870
Here...

10:05.090 --> 10:07.580
Today's your birthday, right?

10:08.020 --> 10:10.500
A present? For me?

10:13.970 --> 10:15.340
Anemone?

10:15.340 --> 10:18.760
Well, you said you liked them, so...

10:25.930 --> 10:27.890
Well? Does it look good on me?

10:29.870 --> 10:30.810
Yes!

10:31.610 --> 10:34.170
Thank you, Destra-kun.

10:34.590 --> 10:38.030
I truly appreciate the sentiment.

10:38.630 --> 10:43.700
But one day, tragedy struck.

10:44.670 --> 10:45.990
There's trouble!

10:50.530 --> 10:53.800
Did we do anything to deserve this?

10:51.730 --> 10:53.210
Wh-What is this?

10:56.540 --> 10:58.200
Everyone, get to the central tower!

10:58.200 --> 10:59.680
It'll be safe there!

10:59.680 --> 11:00.670
Yes, ma'am!

11:18.190 --> 11:19.950
There's no end to them!

11:19.950 --> 11:21.590
Hurry! Move it!

11:21.590 --> 11:23.370
What's going on?!

11:43.640 --> 11:45.180
Ice Spear!

12:07.650 --> 12:08.780
Sensei!

12:08.780 --> 12:11.810
R-Run! Hurry!

12:26.720 --> 12:29.060
Sensei!

12:41.310 --> 12:42.740
Destra!

12:43.730 --> 12:44.680
Destra!

12:44.680 --> 12:45.790
Stop it!

13:01.420 --> 13:02.800
<i>Destra-kun.</i>

13:02.800 --> 13:04.200
Sensei...

13:04.980 --> 13:08.430
Sensei... Sensei...

13:21.610 --> 13:23.860
This is the second time.

13:24.210 --> 13:28.600
You will continue to experience 
despair that drives you to death.

13:28.990 --> 13:30.620
Over and over...

13:30.620 --> 13:32.590
Forever.

13:34.210 --> 13:38.080
The world has denied and rejected you.

13:38.080 --> 13:41.230
Yes. The gods have ordained it.

13:41.230 --> 13:45.630
The gods who created the 
world have ordained it.

13:45.840 --> 13:47.650
I'll curse them!

13:48.070 --> 13:51.130
I'll kill the gods and break the world!

13:51.130 --> 13:53.340
Then wish for it.

13:53.340 --> 13:56.510
Wish for the power to make 
everything you touch despair

13:56.510 --> 14:00.060
and put an end to their very souls!

14:08.070 --> 14:11.070
Wh-What is this?

14:15.180 --> 14:16.340
Destra?

14:17.080 --> 14:19.250
That's... the Fruit of Evolution?!

14:20.250 --> 14:22.460
Don't do it! You mustn't eat it!

14:27.080 --> 14:28.940
Stop!

14:31.310 --> 14:32.830
It's your fault.

14:34.180 --> 14:36.290
You're the one

14:36.920 --> 14:38.600
who brought me here!

14:39.990 --> 14:45.320
I'll throw everything that exists 
into despair and kill them!

14:54.390 --> 14:56.040
N-No...

14:59.390 --> 15:00.620
Bye-bye.

15:01.250 --> 15:06.420
Destra!

15:07.900 --> 15:13.860
If only I had been able to 
protect Libera-kun that day...

15:13.860 --> 15:16.460
Or if I had managed to stop him...

15:18.040 --> 15:19.480
Destra-sama.

15:19.740 --> 15:21.570
I believe it's time.

15:22.130 --> 15:23.500
<i>I know.</i>

15:24.380 --> 15:25.880
Of course.

15:38.980 --> 15:42.120
It's been a long time, Barnabus-sensei.

15:42.120 --> 15:44.420
D-Destra...

15:44.690 --> 15:45.920
See?

15:45.920 --> 15:49.590
We meet again, didn't we, Hiiragi Seiichi-kun?

15:53.010 --> 15:54.440
I can't move!

15:54.440 --> 15:56.050
What is this?

15:57.570 --> 15:59.640
He's stopped our movement.

16:02.060 --> 16:04.120
Now, shall we go?

16:04.120 --> 16:05.350
Wait!

16:07.110 --> 16:09.780
Where are you planning to take him?!

16:10.000 --> 16:12.070
That's none of your business.

16:12.070 --> 16:14.670
It's very much my business!

16:20.040 --> 16:21.410
Barna-san!

16:22.250 --> 16:23.950
Destra,

16:24.290 --> 16:29.150
do you know how sad Libera-kun 
would be if she saw you now?

16:29.150 --> 16:30.650
Don't you say that!

16:32.370 --> 16:34.120
You couldn't do anything!

16:38.470 --> 16:40.690
Stop this already!

16:44.640 --> 16:46.560
Stop it!

16:48.490 --> 16:50.360
Open your eyes, Destra!

16:50.360 --> 16:52.490
Come back to us!

16:52.490 --> 16:55.420
I hate those who are stubborn.

16:56.420 --> 16:58.630
Then perish alongside me.

16:58.970 --> 17:02.540
I'll be the last one you ever kill.

17:03.450 --> 17:04.570
Barna-san!

17:20.510 --> 17:22.340
Barna-san!

17:20.510 --> 17:22.340
Old Man!

17:24.030 --> 17:25.190
You're kidding me...

17:25.960 --> 17:28.290
What a shame, huh?

17:29.430 --> 17:31.610
Destra!

17:32.890 --> 17:34.080
Jutis.

17:34.080 --> 17:36.030
I've been waiting.

17:46.830 --> 17:48.540
Seiichi-sensei?!

17:56.090 --> 17:58.010
Wh-Where am I?

17:58.540 --> 18:01.610
A world made from the accumulation 
of negative emotions.

18:02.840 --> 18:05.770
It's where the Great Devil is sealed.

18:06.550 --> 18:07.820
Destra!

18:07.820 --> 18:09.340
Wow!

18:09.340 --> 18:11.170
Look, look, Seiichi!

18:11.170 --> 18:11.730
Saria?!

18:11.730 --> 18:13.440
Rocks are floating!

18:13.440 --> 18:16.230
She's a special guest...

18:16.230 --> 18:19.360
for the ultimate event that's about to start.

18:19.360 --> 18:20.250
Huh?

18:20.740 --> 18:22.130
Stand back, Saria.

18:22.610 --> 18:24.790
What are you after?

18:24.790 --> 18:28.000
I'm a priest of the Great Devil Order.

18:28.000 --> 18:30.620
Obviously I want the 
Great Devil's resurrection.

18:30.620 --> 18:32.420
Why did you bring us here?

18:33.190 --> 18:35.300
Well...

18:35.300 --> 18:36.380
Take a guess.

18:38.300 --> 18:40.820
You're no fun.

18:40.820 --> 18:42.220
Here's a hint, then.

18:42.480 --> 18:45.890
The power the Great Devil granted 
me was "Absolute Death."

18:45.890 --> 18:49.730
It taints the very soul of all 
living things, kills them,

18:49.730 --> 18:52.110
and cuts them from the 
cycle of reincarnation.

18:52.110 --> 18:56.370
In other words, they won't be 
able to reincarnate or be reborn.

18:56.370 --> 18:58.490
Then Barna-san...

18:58.490 --> 19:01.030
...is bye-bye for all eternity.

19:03.390 --> 19:06.180
I'm grateful to the Great Devil.

19:06.180 --> 19:09.290
He gave me such a fun second life.

19:09.800 --> 19:14.590
Going from the robbed to 
the robber was amazing.

19:14.930 --> 19:19.880
Looking down on people as they drown 
in fear and despair is just the best.

19:19.880 --> 19:22.230
And then the Great Devil will be revived, too.

19:22.230 --> 19:24.470
That'll be the best day ever!

19:24.870 --> 19:26.140
You're crazy.

19:26.140 --> 19:27.710
But I've grown bored.

19:27.710 --> 19:30.410
He hasn't resurrected at all.

19:30.810 --> 19:34.230
Doing things little by little 
just isn't in my nature.

19:34.230 --> 19:35.980
But that's where you come in!

19:36.250 --> 19:39.170
That's what you, the man who ate 
the Fruit of Evolution, are for.

19:39.170 --> 19:42.280
You're planning to use 
my negative energy, then?

19:42.280 --> 19:43.920
Ding-ding!

19:43.920 --> 19:45.310
Too bad, though.

19:45.700 --> 19:48.050
He's right, but still wrong?

19:48.370 --> 19:53.540
I'll resurrect the Great Devil 
and kill him completely!

19:53.800 --> 19:55.700
Kill the Great Devil?

19:56.090 --> 19:58.380
That doesn't make sense!

19:59.210 --> 20:03.300
On that day, in that moment, 
I made my decision!

20:03.300 --> 20:05.940
I'll destroy the world that makes me suffer!

20:05.940 --> 20:09.220
I'll kill all the gods 
that created this world!

20:09.620 --> 20:12.810
I'll wipe out my memories and 
my very existence myself!

20:12.810 --> 20:14.270
Deicide!

20:14.270 --> 20:16.230
That's my goal!

20:16.500 --> 20:18.690
I'll start by killing the Great Devil!

20:19.960 --> 20:23.150
I'll be taking your despair.

20:27.320 --> 20:30.450
Oh! My god!

20:31.560 --> 20:34.870
The time is finally here.

20:35.210 --> 20:36.540
Yes!

20:47.640 --> 20:48.870
Seiichi!

20:52.590 --> 20:53.580
Instant Movement!

20:53.940 --> 20:55.570
Fall Disaster!

20:56.530 --> 20:59.450
Damn it! Why now, of all times?!

21:19.150 --> 21:22.840
Is that all your strength 
amounts to, Seiichi-kun?

21:41.150 --> 21:43.460
You can still avoid my attacks?

21:57.310 --> 21:59.750
I've grown tired of this.

22:00.130 --> 22:01.210
Bye-bye.

23:36.750 --> 23:38.610
Hey, Seiichi-kun,

23:38.610 --> 23:41.830
what do you think lies beyond evolution?

23:41.830 --> 23:43.940
Show it to me.

23:43.940 --> 23:47.820
<b>Next Time
The True Fruit of Evolution</b>

23:44.340 --> 23:47.180
Next time: "The True Fruit of Evolution."

23:47.820 --> 23:49.990
Bye-bye, Hiiragi Seiichi-kun.
